sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant UI as Catalog workspace
    participant Service as Catalog service
    participant Models as Gemini models
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Operator->>UI: Upload CSV or XLSX, or load example
    UI->>Service: File bytes and source filename
    Service->>Service: Validate headers and rows, derive stable IDs
    UI->>DB: Recover saved edits and approvals
    Service->>Service: Process new rows, map colors and sizes
    Service->>Service: Flag missing details, color or price errors
    opt Live mode with missing attributes in useful notes
        Service->>Models: Extract missing attributes at T=0.0
        Models-->>Service: Schema-validated attributes
    end
    opt Live mode with complete product details
        Service->>Models: Generate listing copy at T=0.7
        Models-->>Service: Schema-validated copy
        Service->>Models: Audit source consistency at T=0.1
        Models-->>Service: Schema-validated audit
    end
    Service->>Service: Run fabric and care checks
    Service-->>UI: Review queue, warnings and row errors
    UI->>DB: Save drafts, report partial failures
    Operator->>UI: Select product, compare source, edit
    UI->>Service: Recheck fields and final text
    UI->>DB: Save draft or request approval as MVP team
    DB->>DB: Check revision, final copy and duplicate SKU
    DB-->>UI: Saved result and content-hash audit
    UI-->>Operator: Saved approval and safe CSV export
